                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR STEUERUNG EINES KOCHGERÄTS UND KOCHGERÄT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ DE COMMANDE D'APPAREIL DE CUISSON ET APPAREIL DE CUISSON</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD FOR CONTROLLING COOKING APPLIANCE AND COOKING APPLIANCE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for controlling a cooking appliance includes a blowing fan operation step of operating a blowing fan when a temperature of a cavity reaches a first set temperature, a blowing fan off step of stopping the operation of the blowing fan when the temperature of the cavity increases, and a power off step of cutting off power to the cooking appliance when a temperature of a circuit breaker reaches a cut off set value.</p>
            </abstract>
